         y="202.62192"
         style="font-size:10px"
         id="tspan4010">in cache, ie keeps downloading them everytime I open it and its darn slow. </tspan><tspan
         sodipodi:role="line"
         x="263.52716"
         y="215.12192"
         style="font-size:10px"
         id="tspan4012">Also tried to install all other plugins from ur site (especially aspell) but it </tspan><tspan
